senses.gloss:
लम्भ, अस्, m. the obtaining or attaining, attain-
ment, acquirement; finding, meeting with, recovery;
gain; (आ), f. a sort of fence or enclosure.

लम्बमान, अस्, आ, अम्, hanging down, depend-
ing, descending, dangling, falling, going down;
being large or bulky.

लम्बिन्, ई, इनी, इ, hanging down, depending, pen-
dent, hanging down as far as, hanging on or upon;
(इनी), f. one of the Mātṛs attending on Skanda.
